0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp; ○ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">학과 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">공학계열 학과</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp; ○ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">학점 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">前 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">학기까지 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">100</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">점 환산 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bol